# Recommendation Serving API (Jetty, port 6010)
#
# JVM memory model mapping:
# - Heap: movie/user data, vector indexes, local embedding caches, response objects.
# - Thread stacks: Jetty request threads and Redis client call frames.
# - Metaspace/method area: loaded application, Jetty, Jedis, and JSON/JDK classes.
# - Code cache: JIT-compiled hot recommendation and vector math paths.
-Xms512m
-Xmx1024m
-Xss512k
-XX:MaxMetaspaceSize=256m
-XX:ReservedCodeCacheSize=128m
-XX:MaxDirectMemorySize=128m
-XX:+UseG1GC
-XX:MaxGCPauseMillis=100
-XX:+UseStringDeduplication
-XX:+AlwaysPreTouch
-XX:+HeapDumpOnOutOfMemoryError
-XX:HeapDumpPath=logs/recsys-serving.hprof
-XX:ErrorFile=logs/hs_err_recsys-serving_pid%p.log
-Xlog:gc*,safepoint:file=logs/gc-recsys-serving-%p.log:time,uptime,level,tags:filecount=5,filesize=20M
